rooms_desc ({"The first thing you notice upon entering is the beautiful hardwood floor that seems to have just been polished.  It really shines.  As your gazecomes off the floor, you notice the north wall.  It is all floor to ceilingwindows with a beautiful set of french doors.  In the corner to the left ofthe windows is an intriguing little waterfall.  It falls into a small pondfilled with goldfish.  A stream flows out of the pond through the north wall.In the other corner, you see a rather old but beautiful and sturdy cherry   wood rocking chair.  It reminds you of your grandparents perhaps.  The rest of the room is done tastefully done in white with a pastel peach border along the ceiling with matching peach curtains.  A table with a large vasefilled with brilliant orange carnations stands in the middle of the room.","As you come out through the french doors, you are taken aback by a large,beautiful flower garden.  There are a large variety of flowers here.  On theright side of the path are camillia's, dasies, forget-me-nots, joy, cornflowers,geraniums, lonquils, bluebells, lilacs, daffodils and lillies. On the left sdeof the path are magnolias, roses, tulips, peonies, violets, morning glories,periwinkles, sunflowers, sweet pea blossoms, wisteria, orchids, and sweetwilliam.  There is a book labeled \"The Language of Flowers\" on  a glass p     pedastal.  You also notice that the stream that started in the house meandersthroughout the garden and reenters the house again.  There are several stone benches placed throughout the garden to sit and look at the flowers.  Thisis a very romantic place","This is a small, cozy sitting room.  The north wall is all windows lookingover the beautiful garden.  A loveseat sits facing the window.  There is a small vase vase filled with flowers from the garden sitting on a table inthe northeast corner.  On the west wall, you see a painting.  To the south, see a door.","As you go out through this door, you enter a small apple orchard.  The treesare in perfect lines.  The apples almost look like wax.  You hear buzzingof bees from several hives located throughout the orchard.  Thetrees are full of ripe, red apples.","The hardwood floor continues into this room but what catches your eye as youenter the study is a magnificant desk.  You notice the deks takes up most ofthe southwestern corner.  A large bookcase takes up part of the eastern wall and contains several books by the some of the authors of the time and manuscripts by plato, socrates and other great philosophers/playwrigths.On the rest of the east wall are pictures of Notud's ancestors.  In thenortwestern corner are two chairs and a small table.","You feel a somber mood descend over you as you enter this room.  This is whereNotud comes to think out his problems.  In the middle of the roomsits a couch and two chairs for his real good friends to sit inwhile they talk with about his and their problems.  Scattered about theroom are ferns, pansies, heather and petunias.  The norhtern wall is made of glass and looks into a small atrium.","You step onto plush carpeting as you enter the master bedroom.  Whatreally cathes your eye is the magnificant, four-poster bed in the centerof the room.  It has a soft down matress and pillows to match.  The sheetsare made of the softest cotton.  An oak hope chest lies at the foot ofthe bed.  Along the west wall sits a nicely carved cherry dresser.  Asmall cherry vanity with and exquisite mirror above it sits along the northwall.  Several candles placed around the room and the slight smell of inscense gives the room a romantic atmosphere.","The room feels a little humid as you enter it.  The source of that humidityseems to be a curious little pond with a waterfall to the right.On the northern wall, you see a glass-enclosed room filled with steam.A little to left on the wall in front of you is a beautiful marblewas basin with a mirror above it.  As you look up, you see the roof is madeentirely of windows to let the sun or perhaps to let one look out at thestars at night.  Two soft, cotton robes hang to the right of the door.","Mmmmm...the steam starts to relax you right away.  As you look around,you notice this steam room is only built for two.","As you enter the room, you realize is is completely enclosed in glass.  It isbare except for some petunias and heather around the room.  This is whereNotud comes to be in complete solitude when he wants to think thingsthrough.  It overlooks a small, peaceful lake just outside.",})
rooms_short ({"Notud's entry room","A beautiful flower garden","A small sitting room","An apple orchard","The study","The discussion room","The master bedroom","The master bathroom","Steam room in master bedroom","A small atrium",})
